cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "State-to-Congress Legislators: Linking State and Federal Legislative Sponsorship Records, 1979-Present"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhong
    given-names: Ardis
    affiliation: "San Diego State University, MA Political Science"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ardis-zhong/state-to-congress-legislators"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-08-30
abstract: >
  A linked dataset and pipeline tracking U.S. legislators who served in a
  state legislature before or during their time in Congress, 1979-present.
  Combines federal sponsored-legislation records (via Congress.gov) with
  state sponsored-legislation records (via LegiScan) for the same set of
  people, matched across both data sources.
